; A node naming a type the registry beside it does not declare. It is canonical,
; so `dfcad fmt --check` passes over it and only `dfcad check` has anything to
; say — which is the point: the two stages of the gate answer different
; questions, and the self-test requires both of them to answer.
(node
  site:S-002
  (label "Meeting Room B")
  (kind Space)
  (type BroomCupboard)
  (geometry area)
  (frame frame:building))
